<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Merck  ERCK.Z.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Merck  ERCK.Z.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued two million European-style call warrants on Merck AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    70 DEM		    PREMIUM	25.44 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     7.40 DEM		  GEARING	4.57 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   11.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	18.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES/STUT	   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  67.6 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     WARRANT HOLDERS WILL RECEIVE AN ADDITIONAL</p>
<p>		     10 MARKS IF THE UNDERLYING NEVER TRADES BELOW</p>
<p>		     62 MARKS BETWEEN 11.MAR.97 TO MATURITY.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
